he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Gestational age < 32 weeks\n-  Birthweight <1500 g\n-  Age less than 72 hours\n-  PDA diameter > 1.5 mm\n-  Signed informed consent obtained from both parents\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Gestational age < 32 weeks",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "<"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "weeks"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "32"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "< 32 weeks"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "Gestational age"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "Gestational age"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Birthweight <1500 g",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "<"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "1500"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "<1500 g"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "Birthweight"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "Birthweight"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Unit": [\n                        "g"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Age less than 72 hours",\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "less than"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "72"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "less than 72 hours"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "Age"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "hours"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- PDA diameter > 1.5 mm",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                ">"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "1.5"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "> 1.5 mm"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "PDA diameter"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "PDA diameter"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit": [\n                "mm"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Signed informed consent obtained from both parents"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
