he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients who will not want to participate to the study\n-  revision surgeries\n-  if the patient is taking antidepressants during the last 6 months\n-  if the patient has a history of a disease that can affect anxiety levels\n-  if patient wants to be excluded from the study\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- patients who will not want to participate to the study",\n                  "Study": [\n                    "study"\n                  ],\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "not"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "not"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- revision surgeries",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "revision surgeries"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "revision surgeries"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- if the patient is taking antidepressants during the last 6 months",\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "taking",\n                "last 6 months"\n              ],\n              "Drug": [\n                "antidepressants"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "taking"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "antidepressants"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "mont