elds such as "Drug", "Condition", "Observation", "Age"... can appear next to "raw_text" to categorise specific terms.\n\n4. Extract the following entities from the raw text and include them in the JSON object:\nNodes could include attributes such as:\n- "raw_text": A string representing the raw text description of the medical condition, procedure, or other relevant details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  age ≥18 years\n-  BMI ≤40 kg/m2\n-  indication for hysterectomy for benign disease or prophylactic surgery due to hereditary cancer\n-  indication for radical hysterectomy and/or pelvic-/para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for cervical cancer\n-  indication for modified radical hysterectomy and/or pelvic-/para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for endometrial cancer\n-  size of uterus and vagina allows for retrieval by the vaginal route in cancer patients\n-  written informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- age ≥18 years",\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "≥"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "years"\n                          ],\n                          "Age": [\n                            "age"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "18"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "≥18 years"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "- BMI ≤40 kg/m2",\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "BMI"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "BMI"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "≤"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "40"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "≤40 kg/m2"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Unit": [\n                            "kg",\n                            "m2"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- indication for hysterectomy for benign disease",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "hysterectomy"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "hysterectomy"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "benign disease"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "benign disease"\n                          ],\n                          "Indication": [\n                            "indication"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or prophylactic surgery due to hereditary cancer",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "prophylactic surgery"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "prophylactic surgery"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "hereditary"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- indication for radical hysterectomy",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "hysterectomy"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "hysterectomy"\n                      ],\n                      "Indication": [\n                        "indication"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "radical"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "and/or pelvic-/",\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "pelvic"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for cervical cancer",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "cancer"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "lymphadenectomy"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "lymphadenectomy"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "para-aortic",\n                            "sentinel-node",\n                            "cervical"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- indication for modified radical hysterectomy",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "hysterectomy"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "hysterectomy"\n                  ],\n                  "Indication": [\n                    "indication"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "modified radical"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "and/or pelvic-/",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "pelvic"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "para-aortic (sentinel-node) lymphadenectomy for endometrial cancer",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "lymphadenectomy"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "lymphadenectomy"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "para-aortic",\n                        "sentinel-node",\n                        "endometrial"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- size of uterus and vagina allows for retrieval by the vaginal route in cancer patients",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cancer"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "cancer"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "size of uterus and vagina"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "size of uterus and vagina"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "allows for"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "retrieval by the vaginal route"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "retrieval by the vaginal route"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- written informed consent"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
