he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Smoking;\n-  Alcohol consumption;\n-  Use of diuretics and/or antihypertensive medications;\n-  Liver and kidney disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Smoking;",\n              "Observation": [\n                "Smoking"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Smoking"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Alcohol consumption;",\n              "Observation": [\n                "Alcohol consumption"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Alcohol consumption"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Use of diuretics",\n              "Drug": [\n                "diuretics"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "diuretics"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Use"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "Use"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and/or antihypertensive medications;",\n              "Drug": [\n                "antihypertensive medications"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "antihypertensive medications"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Liver",\n          "Modifier": [\n            "Liver"\n          ]\n        },\n 