he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n• Liver transplantation candidates with one or more of the following:\n-  inability to perform >4 METs by history\n-  insulin-treated diabetes mellitus\n-  serum creatinine >152μmol/l\n-  history of MI, PCI or CABG\n-  stable angina\n-  cerebrovascular disease\n-  peripheral vascular disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "• Liver transplantation candidates",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "Liver transplantation"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "Liver transplantation"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "candidates"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "with one or more of the following:",\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "one or more"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "one"\n                                  ],\n               