he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  We will exclude patients with any other possible cause of thrombocytopenia either immune or non immune as:\n-  Patients with diabetes\n-  HCV\n-  other autoimmune disease (as SLE or RA)\n-  Chronic Liver or kidney disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- We will exclude patients with any other possible cause of thrombocytopenia either immune or non immune as:",\n              "Condition": [\n                "thrombocytopenia"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "thrombocytopenia"\n              ],\n              "Other": [\n                "other"\n              ],\n              "Exception": [\n                "exclude"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "immune",\n                "non immune"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients with diabetes",\n              "Condition": [\n                "diabetes"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "diabetes"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- HCV",\n          "Condition": [\n            "HCV"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "HCV"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- other autoimmune disease (as SLE",\n          "Condition": [\n            "autoimmune disease",\n            "SLE"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "autoimmune disease",\n         