he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Undertake regular exercise at least 3 times a week with accumulation of 150 min per week\n-  Age between 20 and 30 years old\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Undertake regular exercise at least 3 times a week with accumulation of 150 min per week",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "at least 3 times a week",\n        "150 min per week"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "exercise"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "at least"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "3",\n        "150"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "week"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "exercise"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "regular"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Times": [\n        "3 times"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Unit": [\n        "min"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Age between 20 and 30 years old",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "between 20 and 30 years"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "Age"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "between"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "20",\n        "30"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
