he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Federated boxers\n-  Over 18 years\n-  Male\n-  With non-specific back pain that does not incapacitate them for the realization of their sport or work activity.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Federated boxers",\n              "Observation": [\n                "Federated boxers"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Federated boxers"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Over 18 years",\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Over 18 years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "age"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "18"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "Over"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Male",\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "Male"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- With"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "non-specific back pain that does not incapacitate them for the realization of their sport or work activity.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "back pain"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "back pain"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "non-specific"\n  