he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Present a medical diagnosis of injury or illness\n-  Have suffered a knee injury in the 6 months prior to the study\n-  Doing some pharmacological or physiotherapy treatment external to the study\n-  Not signed the informed consent document.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Present a medical diagnosis of injury",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "medical"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or illness",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "illness"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "illness"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Have suffered a knee injury in the 6 months prior to the study",\n              "Observation": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "injury"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "6 months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "6"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ],\n              "Modifier":