he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients with intra-ocular surgery as cataract surgery within 6 months\n-  prior intravitreal injection of any drug within the preceding 6 months\n-  panretinal photocoagulation (PRP) within the former 4 months.\n-  Patients with previous macular laser\n-  patients with vitreo-macular traction (VMT) syndrome\n-  severe glaucoma\n-  other retinal vascular diseases\n-  conditions that impede the OCT interpretation\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- patients with intra-ocular surgery as cataract surgery within 6 months",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "intra-ocular surgery",\n                                "cataract surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "intra-ocular surgery",\n                                "cataract surgery"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "within 6 months"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "within"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "6"\n                              ],\n         