he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Woman ≥ 18 years old\n-  undergoing laparoscopic surgery for endometriosis, uterine myoma\'s, hysterectomy or colpopexy.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Woman ≥ 18 years old",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "≥ 18 years"\n      ],\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "Woman"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "≥"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "old"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- undergoing laparoscopic surgery for endometriosis,",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "laparoscopic surgery"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "laparoscopic surgery"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "endometriosis"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "endometriosis"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "undergoing"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "undergoing"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "uterine myoma\'s,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "uterine myoma"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "uterine myoma"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "hysterectomy",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "hysterectomy"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "h