he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patient is EBV (epstein barr virus)-negative on serology.\n-  Patient is HIV-positive or suffering from chronic viral hepatitis.\n-  Patient is CMV (cytomegalo virus)-negative and receiving a kidney from a CMV-positive donor.\n-  Positive T-cell lymphocytotoxic cross match.\n-  Patient with prior kidney transplant or non-renal solid organ transplant.\n-  Patient has a known contraindication to any of the protocol-specified treatments.\n-  Patient had been diagnosed with a malignancy within 5 years prior to study entry, excluding non-metastatic basal or squamous cell carcinoma of the skin.\n-  Female patients who are breast-feeding.\n-  Female patients with a positive pregnancy test.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Patient is EBV (epstein barr virus)-negative on serology.",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "EBV",\n                                "epstein barr virus"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "EBV",\n                                "epstein barr virus"\n                              ],\n                              "Polarity": [\n                                "negative"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "serology"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "serology"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Patient is HIV-positive",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "HIV"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "HIV"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Polarity": [\n                                    "positive"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or suffering from chronic viral hepatitis.",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "viral hepatitis"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "viral hepatitis"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Acuteness": [\n                                    "chronic"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Patient is CMV (cytomegalo virus)-negative",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "CMV",\n                                "cytomegalo virus"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "CMV",\n                                "cytomegalo virus"\n                              ],\n                              "Polarity": [\n                                "negative"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "and receiving a kidney from a CMV-positive donor.",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "CMV"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "CMV"\n                              ],\n                              "Polarity": [\n                                "positive"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure": [\n                                "kidney"\n                              ],\n                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                "kidney"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "receiving"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                "receiving"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "donor"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Positive T-cell lymphocytotoxic cross match.",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "T-cell lymphocytotoxic cross match"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "T-cell lymphocytotoxic cross match"\n                      ],\n                      "Polarity": [