he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients met diagnostic criteria for schizophrenia or schizoaffective disorder using the Structural Clinical Interview for Diagnostic and Statistical Manual Diploma in Social Medicine (DSM)-IV (SCID, Version 2.0).\n-  Patients remain their psychotropic medication at steady dosages for at least 4 weeks prior to study entry and for the duration of the trial.\n-  Verbal intelligence quotient > 85 as measured by using a Chinese version of the National Adult Reading Test.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients met diagnostic criteria for schizophrenia",\n              "Condition": [\n                "schizophrenia"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "schizophrenia"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or schizoaffective disorder using the Structural Clinical Interview for Diagnostic and Statistical Manual Diploma in Social Medicine (DSM)-IV (SCID, Version 2.0).",\n              "Condition": [\n                "schizoaffective disorder"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "schizoaffective disorder"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "Structural Clinical Interview for Diagnostic and Statistical Manual Diploma in Social Medicine",\n                "SCID"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Structural Clinical Interview for Diagnostic and Statistical Manual Diploma in Social Medicine",\n                "SCID"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison"