he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  participated in structured weight training during the previous 12 month\n-  vegetarian or vegan\n-  presence of chronic disease\n-  pregnant, postpartum up to six months, lactating, or intention to become pregnant\n-  allergy to whey or soy\n-  changes in body weight more than 10 pounds in the past three months\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- participated in structured weight training during the previous 12 month",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "previous 12 month"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "weight training"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "-"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "previous"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "12"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "month"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "weight training"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- vegetarian",\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "-"\n                          ],\