he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Age >18 years\n-  Diagnosis of BCR‐ABL positive CML blast crisis according to the WHO criteria:\n-  Blasts 20% or more of peripheral blood white cells or bone marrow cells or\n-  Extramedullary blast proliferation or\n-  Large foci or clusters of blasts in bone marrow biopsy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Age >18 years",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            ">"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "Age"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "18"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            ">18 years"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of BCR‐ABL positive CML blast crisis according to the WHO criteria:",\n          "Condition": [\n            "CML",\n            "CML blast crisis"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "CML",\n            "CML blast crisis"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "BCR‐ABL"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "BCR‐ABL"\n          ],\n          "Polarity": [\n            "positive"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Blasts 20% or more of peripheral blood white cells",\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "20"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "20% or more"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "%"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "or more"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "Blasts"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Blasts"\n          ],\n          "Specimen": [\n            "peripheral blood white cells"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or bone marrow cells",\n              "Specimen": [\n                "bone marrow cells"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Extramedullary blast proliferation",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Extramedullary blast proliferation"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Extramedullary blast proliferation"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
