elds such as "Drug", "Condition", "Observation", "Age"... can appear next to "raw_text" to categorise specific terms.\n\n4. Extract the following entities from the raw text and include them in the JSON object:\nNodes could include attributes such as:\n- "raw_text": A string representing the raw text description of the medical condition, procedure, or other relevant details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Age less than 21 years old\n2. Any prior cancer diagnosis, without or with any treatment (e.g., medical, surgical, or radiation oncology) within prior six months.\n3. Any surgery, i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month.\n4. Any non-cancer systemic therapy associated with molecularly targeted immune modulation, e.g., monoclonal antibodies.\n5. Any concurrent or prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.\n6. Any history of organ tissue transplantation\n7. Any history of blood product transfusion within prior month.\n8. Any major trauma within prior six months, e.g., burn injury, extremity crush injury, motor vehicle accident, etc.\n9. Unable to provide informed consent.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "1. Age less than 21 years old",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "less than 21 years"\n                              ],\n                              "Age": [\n                                "Age"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "less than"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "21"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                "years"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. Any prior cancer diagnosis,",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "cancer"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "cancer"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "prior"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "prior"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "without or with any treatment (e.g., medical,",\n                                      "Procedure": [\n                                        "treatment"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                                        "medical"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Exception": [\n                                        "without"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "surgical,",\n                                          "Procedure": [\n                                            "surgical"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                                            "surgical"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "raw_text": "or radiation oncology) within prior six months.",\n                                          "Procedure": [\n                                            "radiation oncology"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                                            "radiation oncology"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                            "within prior six months"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                                            "within"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                            "prior"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Value": [\n                                            "six"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                                            "months"\n                                          ]\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "3. Any surgery, i.e., invasive procedure performed in the operating room with any level of anesthesia, within prior month.",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "surgery",\n                            "invasive procedure",\n                            "anesthesia"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "surgery",\n                            "invasive procedure",\n                            "anesthesia"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "within prior month"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "within"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "prior"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "month"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "4. Any non-cancer systemic therapy associated with molecularly targeted immune modulation, e.g., monoclonal antibodies.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "systemic therapy",\n                        "molecularly targeted immune modulation",\n                        "monoclonal antibodies"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "systemic therapy",\n                        "molecularly targeted immune modulation",\n                        "monoclonal antibodies"\n                      ],\n                      "Exception": [\n                        "non"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "5. Any concurrent",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "concurrent"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or prior pregnancy within previous twelve months.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "pregnancy"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "pregnancy"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "within previous twelve months",\n                        "prior"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "within"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "prior",\n                        "previous"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "twelve"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "months"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "6. Any history of organ tissue transplantation",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "organ tissue transplantation"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "organ tissue transplantation"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "history"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "history"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "7. Any history of blood product transfusion within prior month.",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "within prior month",\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "within"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "prior",\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "month"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "blood product transfusion"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "blood product transfusion"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "8. Any major trauma within prior six months, e.g., burn injury,",\n          "Observation": [\n            "trauma"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "trauma"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "within prior six months"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "within"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "prior"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "six"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "months"\n          ],\n          "Severity": [\n            "major"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "burn injury"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "burn injury"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "extremity crush injury,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "extremity crush injury"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "extremity crush injury"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "motor vehicle accident, etc.",\n              "Observation": [\n                "motor vehicle accident"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "motor vehicle accident"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
