he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients admitted in the non-critical areas of the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición Salvador Zubirán (INCMNSZ) with a nutritional risk between January 2019 and July 2020 will be considered eligible.\n-  Patients with recent diagnosis of IF type II (an evolution >28 days) originate from various gastrointestinal or systemic diseases (short bowel, intestinal fistula, intestinal dysmotility, mechanical obstruction, and extensive small bowel mucosal disease).\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients admitted in the non-critical areas of the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición Salvador Zubirán (INCMNSZ) with a nutritional risk between January 2019 and July 2020 will be considered eligible.",\n      "Encounter": [\n        "admitted"\n      ],\n      "Location": [\n        "Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición Salvador Zubirán",\n        "INCMNSZ"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "nutritional risk"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "nutritional risk"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "between"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "January 2019",\n        "July 2020"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "between January 2019 and July 2020"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "admitted"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with recent diagnosis of IF type II (an evolution >28 days) originate from various gastrointestinal",\n          "Condition": [\n            "IF"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "IF"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            ">"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "28"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            ">28 days"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "recent"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "days"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "gastrointestinal",\n            "type II"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "days"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or systemic diseases (short bowel,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "short bowel",\n                "diseases"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "short bowel"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "systemic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "intestinal fistula,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "intestinal fistula"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "intestinal fistula"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "intestinal dysmotility,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "intestinal dysmotility"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "intestinal dysmotility"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "mechanical obstruction,",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "mechanical obstruction"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                          