he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients having conditions otherwise which limit physical activity or neurocognitive assessment\n-  Do not have a smart phone\n-  History of past moderate/severe TBI,\n-  Substance abuse,\n-  Major psychiatric condition,\n-  Vestibular disorder,\n-  Cardiac condition,\n-  Unable to provide consent/assent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "- Patients having conditions otherwise which limit physical activity",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "conditions"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "physical activity"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Stability": [\n                                    "limit"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation-Name": [\n                                    "physical activity"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Assertion": [\n                                    "limit"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n             