he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Any disease or medical condition that, in the opinion of the investigator, would make the subject unsuitable for this study, would interfere with the interpretation of subject safety or study results, or considered unsuitable by the investigator for any other reason\n-  Evidence of active tuberculosis (TB)\nOther protocol defined inclusion/exclusion criteria could apply\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Any disease",\n              "Condition": [\n                "disease"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "disease"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or medical condition that, in the opinion of the investigator, would make the subject unsuitable for this study, would interfere with the interpretation of subject safety",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "medical condition"\n                  ],\n                  "Study": [\n                    "study"\n                  ],\n                  "Stability": [\n                    "interfere"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "unsuitable"\n                  ],\n                  "Risk": [\n                    "safety"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or study results, or considered unsuitable by the investigator for any other reason",\n                  "Study": [\n                    "study"\n                  ],\n     