he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Adanced male factor endometriosis uterine abnormality sever semen parameters i impairment according to WHO 2010 non ovulatory cycles bilatral tubal block\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Adanced male factor endometriosis uterine abnormality sever semen parameters i impairment according to WHO 2010",\n      "Condition": [\n        "endometriosis",\n        "uterine abnormality",\n        "semen parameters i impairment"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "endometriosis",\n        "uterine abnormality",\n        "semen parameters i impairment"\n      ],\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "male"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "semen parameters"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "semen parameters"\n      ],\n      "Severity": [\n        "sever"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "NOT": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "non ovulatory cycles bilatral tubal block",\n          "Condition": [\n            "ovulatory cycles",\n            "bilatral tubal block"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "ovulatory cycles",\n            "bilatral tubal block"\n          ],\n          "Negation": [\n            "non"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
Response: {
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "raw_text": "- Adanced male factor endometriosis uterine abnormality sever semen parameters i impairment according to WHO 2010",
      "Condition": [
