he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Sample of 40 healthy ASA I or II donors\' candidate for right lobe hepatectomy for living donor liver transplantation\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- Sample of 40 healthy ASA I or II donors\' candidate for right lobe hepatectomy for living donor liver transplantation",\n  "Eq-Value": [\n    "40"\n  ],\n  "Observation": [\n    "ASA"\n  ],\n  "Observation-Name": [\n    "ASA"\n  ],\n  "Condition": [\n    "healthy"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "healthy"\n  ],\n  "Procedure": [\n    "right lobe hepatectomy",\n    "liver transplantation"\n  ],\n  "Procedure-Name": [\n    "right lobe hepatectomy",\n    "liver transplantation"\n  ],\n  "Assertion": [\n    "candidate for"\n  ],\n  "Modifier": [\n    "living donor"\n  ]\n}<|eot_id|>']
