he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Active infection that increases the risk of secondary infection in the skin where the vesicles containing interstitial fluid have been emptied of interstitial fluid with a fine needle and the bladder roof is intact.\n-  Treatment with Warfarin due to increased risk of Calciphylaxis (calcific uremic arteriolopathy, CUA)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Active infection that increases the risk of secondary infection in the skin where the vesicles containing interstitial fluid have been emptied of interstitial fluid with a fine needle and the bladder roof is intact.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "infection"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "infection"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "Active"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "Active"\n      ],\n      "Risk": [\n        "risk"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "skin",\n        "vesicles containing interstitial fluid",\n        "bladder roof"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "emptied of interstitial fluid"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "emptied of interstitial fluid"\n      ],\n      "Stability": [\n        "increases"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "risk"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "secondary infection"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "secondary infection"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Treatment with Warfarin due to increased risk of Calciphylaxis (calcific uremic arteriolopathy, CUA)",\n      "Drug": [\n        "Warfarin"\n      ],\n      "Drug-Name": [\n        "Warfarin"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "Calciphylaxis",\n        "calcific uremic arteriolopathy",\n        "CUA"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "Calciphylaxis",\n        "calcific uremic arteriolopathy",\n        "CUA"\n      ],\n      "Risk": [\n        "risk"\n      ],\n      "Stability": [\n        "increased"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "Treatment"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "risk"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
