he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  < 38 years\n-  PCOS patients with polycystic ovarian morphology: at least 25 follicles (2-9 mm) throughout the whole ovary and/or increased ovarian volume (>10ml) (it is sufficient that 1 ovary fits these criteria)\n-  No major uterine or ovarian abnormalities\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- < 38 years",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "< 38 years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "<"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "38"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "years"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- PCOS patients with polycystic ovarian morphology: at least 25 follicles (2-9 mm) throughout the whole ovary",\n              "Condition": [\n                "PCOS",\n                "polycystic ovarian morphology"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "PCOS",\n                "polycystic ovarian morphology"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "at least 25 follicles",\n                "2-9 mm"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "at least",\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "25",\n                "2",\n                "9"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit": [\n                "follicles",\n                "mm"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "follicles"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "follicles"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "ovary"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "and/or increased ovarian volume (>10ml) (it is sufficient that 1 ovary fits these criteria)",\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                ">10ml"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                ">"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "10"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit": [\n                "ml"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "ovarian volume"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "ovarian volume"\n              ],\n              "Polarity": [\n                "increased"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "ovary"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "-"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "No major uterine",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "uterine"\n                  ],\n                  "Severity": [\n                    "major"\n                  ],\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "No"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or ovarian abnormalities",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "abnormalities"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "abnormalities"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "ovarian"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
