he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Recent cardiorespiratory exacerbation (<6 weeks).\n-  Pulmonary rehabilitation program during the last 2 months\n-  Continuous LTOT (24 hours) or deambulation O2 therapy alone\n-  Anticoagulant drugs\n-  Hematocrit outside the normal range (35-50%)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Recent cardiorespiratory exacerbation (<6 weeks).",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cardiorespiratory exacerbation"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "cardiorespiratory exacerbation"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Recent",\n                    "<6 weeks"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "Recent"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "<"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "6"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "weeks"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Pulmonary rehabilitation program during the last 2 months",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "Pulmonary rehabilitation program"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "Pulmonary rehabilitation program"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "last 2 months"\n                  ],\n   