he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Age < 18 years\n-  Unable to take part in the study according to the Investigator opinion (example: unable to understand the study information leaflet, unable to provide written consent, etc.)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Age < 18 years",\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "<"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "Age"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "< 18 years"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Unable to take part in the study according to the Investigator opinion (example: unable to understand the study information leaflet, unable to provide written consent, etc.)",\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
