he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Subjects over 18 and under 75 years of age undergoing elective primary orthopaedic surgery at Thomas Jefferson University Hospital, Rothman Orthopaedic Specialty Hospital or Methodist Hospital who have the capability to utilize a telecommunications platform (computer, tablet or similar device at home with a webcam, microphone and access to high-speed internet).\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "1. Subjects over 18 and under 75 years of age undergoing elective primary orthopaedic surgery at Thomas Jefferson University Hospital, Rothman Orthopaedic Specialty Hospital",\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "age"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18",\n        "75"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "over 18",\n        "under 75 years",\n        "undergoing"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "over",\n        "under"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "primary orthopaedic surgery"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "primary orthopaedic surgery"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "undergoing"\n      ],\n      "Location": [\n        "Thomas Jefferson University Hospital",\n        "Rothman Orthopaedic Specialty Hospital"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "or Methodist Hospital who have the capability to utilize a telecommunications platform (computer, tablet or similar device at home with a webcam, microphone and access to high-speed internet).",\n      "Location": [\n        "Methodist Hospital"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
