he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients under the age of 18\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Active infection\n-  Patients with known malignancies\n-  patients without consent\n-  known arrhythmia, dilated or hypertrophic cardiomyopathy, heart failure (EF <40%)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients under the age of 18",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "under the age of 18"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "age"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "under"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "18"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Pregnancy",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Pregnancy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Pregnancy"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Active infection",\n              "Condition": [\n                "infection"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "infection"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "Active"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "Active"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients with known malignancies",\n              "Condition": [\n                "malignancies"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "malignancies"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- patients without consent"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- known arrhythmia,",\n          "Condition": [\n            "arrhythmia"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "arrhythmia"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "dilated",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "dilated"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or hypertrophic cardiomyopathy,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cardiomyopathy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "cardiomyopathy"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "hypertrophic"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "heart failure (EF <40%)",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "heart failure"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "heart failure"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "<"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "40"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "<40%"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "EF"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "EF"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Unit": [\n                    "%"\n                  ]\n                