he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients with a compromised medical history.\n-  Severe or active periodontal disease.\n-  Heavy bruxism or a traumatic occlusion.\n-  Acute or chronic dental infection.\n-  Pregnant or breastfeeding women.\n-  Patients with posterior restorations on molars or premolars\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients with a compromised medical history.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "compromised medical history"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "compromised medical history"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Severe",\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "Severe"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or active periodontal disease.",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "periodontal disease"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "periodontal disease"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "active"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            