elds such as "Drug", "Condition", "Observation", "Age"... can appear next to "raw_text" to categorise specific terms.\n\n4. Extract the following entities from the raw text and include them in the JSON object:\nNodes could include attributes such as:\n- "raw_text": A string representing the raw text description of the medical condition, procedure, or other relevant details.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients older than 18 years old\n-  Cerebral infarct within the anterior circulation due to occlusion of intracranial carotid artery or proximal (M1) MCA.\n-  With acute MRI performed within the first 24h and showing significant penumbra defined as ratio between the volumes of critically hypoperfused tissue (defined by Tmax>6s) and the ischemic core (defined by ADC<600 × 10-6 mm2/s) of 1.8 or more, with an absolute difference of 15 mL or more and ischemic core volume of less than 70 mL.\n-  Successful recanalization (TICI 2b-3) by thrombectomy alone or in combination with IV thrombolysis (if within the first 4.5h).\n-  Patient/Legally Authorized Representative has signed the Informed Consent form.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients older than 18 years old",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "older than 18 years"\n                  ],\n                  "Age": [\n                    "older"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "18"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "years"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "older than"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Cerebral infarct within the anterior circulation due to occlusion of intracranial carotid artery",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Cerebral infarct",\n                        "occlusion of intracranial carotid artery"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Cerebral infarct",\n                        "occlusion of intracranial carotid artery"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "anterior circulation"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or proximal (M1) MCA.",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "proximal (M1) MCA"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- With acute MRI performed within the first 24h and showing significant penumbra defined as ratio between the volumes of critically hypoperfused tissue (defined by Tmax>6s) and the ischemic core (defined by ADC<600 × 10-6 mm2/s) of 1.8 or more, with an absolute difference of 15 mL or more and ischemic core volume of less than 70 mL.",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "MRI"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "MRI"\n              ],\n              "Acuteness": [\n                "acute"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "within the first 24h",\n                "Tmax>6s",\n                "ADC<600 × 10-6 mm2/s",\n                "1.8 or more",\n                "15 mL or more",\n                "less than 70 mL"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "within",\n                ">"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "24",\n                "6",\n                "1.8",\n                "15",\n                "70"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "h"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "first"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit": [\n                "mL",\n                "mm2",\n                "s"\n              ],\n              "Severity": [\n                "significant"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "Tmax",\n                "ADC",\n                "ischemic core volume"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "Tmax",\n                "ADC",\n                "ischemic core volume"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "penumbra",\n                "hypoperfused tissue",\n                "ischemic core"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "penumbra",\n                "hypoperfused tissue",\n                "ischemic core"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Unit-Name": [\n                "L"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Successful recanalization (TICI 2b-3) by thrombectomy alone",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "thrombectomy",\n                "thrombectomy alone"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "thrombectomy",\n                "thrombectomy alone"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "recanalization"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "recanalization"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "TICI"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "TICI"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "2b-3"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "2b",\n                "3"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or in combination with IV thrombolysis (if within the first 4.5h).",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "IV thrombolysis"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "IV thrombolysis"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "within the first 4.5h"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "within"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "4.5"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "h"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "first"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patient/Legally Authorized Representative has signed the Informed Consent form."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
