omen"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- One-wall intrabony defects",\n              "Condition": [\n                "One-wall intrabony defects"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "One-wall intrabony defects"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Defects that involve buccal and lingual sites"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Presence of inadequate endodontic treatment",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "endodontic treatment"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "endodontic treatment"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "inadequate"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and/or restoration in the relevant teeth.",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "restoration"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "restoration"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "relevant teeth"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
