he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Provision of written informed consent\n2. Age > or = to 65 years\n3. Hip fracture location within the femoral neck, intertrochanteric, and subtrochanteric regions\n4. Indication for one of the following surgical interventions: hemiarthroplasty, total hip replacement, sliding plate and screw fixation, or intramedullary fixation\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "1. Provision of written informed consent"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "2. Age > or = to 65 years",\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "65 years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "Age"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "65"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                ">"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "3. Hip fracture location within the femoral neck,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "fracture"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "fracture"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "femoral neck",\n                "Hip"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "intertrochanteric,",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "intertrochanteric"\n                  ]\n                