he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Gastroscopy can be performed\n-  Serologic markers including serum pepsinogen can be measured\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Gastroscopy can be performed",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "Gastroscopy"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "Gastroscopy"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "can be"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Serologic markers including serum pepsinogen can be measured",\n      "Observation": [\n        "Serologic markers",\n        "serum pepsinogen"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "Serologic markers",\n        "serum pepsinogen"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "can be"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
