he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Subject has signed an informed consent form prior to any study-specific procedures being performed\n2. Subject is an ambulatory female at least 18 years of age\n3. Subject agrees to adhere to the study requirements\n4. Subject agrees not to be the primary caregiver of any dependents during the infusion\n5. Subject must have a negative pregnancy test on Day 1 prior to the start of the ZULRESSO infusion\n6. Subject has a current diagnosis of PPD, as assessed by the Investigator\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "1. Subject has signed an informed consent form prior to any study-specific procedures being performed",\n                      "Study": [\n                        "study"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "procedures"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "2. Subject is an ambulatory female at least 18 years of age",\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "years"\n                      ],\n                      "Age": [\n                        "age"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "18"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "at least 18 years"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "at least"\n