he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  History of neurological injury, gait pathology, or cardiovascular condition that would limit your ability to ambulate for multiple hours.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "OR": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- History of neurological injury,",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "History"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "neurological"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "injury"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "History"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "injury"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "gait pathology,",\n          "Condition": [\n            "gait pathology"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "gait pathology"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or cardiovascular condition that would limit your ability to ambulate for multiple hours.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cardiovascular condition"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "cardiovascular condition"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "ambulate"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "ambulate"\n          ],\n          "Stability": [\n            "limit"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "would"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "multiple hours"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "multiple"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "hours"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
