he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  <30 or >69 years old\n-  BMI <25.0 or >37 kg/m2\n-  Fasting serum total cholesterol > 260 mg/dL\n-  Low-density lipoprotein cholesterol >189 mg/dL\n-  Glucose >110 mg/dL\n-  Systolic/diastolic blood pressure > 140/90\n-  Body weight stable for <3 months prior (±3 kg)\n-  Stable physical activity regimen < 3 months prior\n-  Medication use unstable for 6 months prior and using medications\n-  Smoking\n-  Drinking more than 2 alcoholic drinks per day\n-  Diabetic\n-  Have renal failure\n-  Have liver failure\n-  Have cardiovascular events (myocardial infarction or stroke) during the 6 months prior to the study\n-  Pregnant or lactating\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "AND": {\n                                                "left": {\n                                                  "AND": {\n                                                    "left": {\n                                          