he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients with type 2 diabetes for more than 5 years.\n-  Patients who were diagnosed according to the criteria of the American diabetes association.\n-  Not receiving any drugs affecting the data obtained\n-  had Normal daily diets\n-  Not participating in any other exercise programs\n-  Without any musculoskeletal disorders affecting an exercise program\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- patients with type 2 diabetes for more than 5 years.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "diabetes"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "diabetes"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "more than 5 years"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "more than"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "5"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "years"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "type 2"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients who were diagnosed according to the criteria of the American diabetes association.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "diabetes"\n                   