he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Agranulocytosis\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Allergy to mebendazole.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Agranulocytosis",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Agranulocytosis"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Agranulocytosis"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Pregnancy",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Pregnancy"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Pregnancy"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Allergy to mebendazole.",\n      "Drug": [\n        "mebendazole"\n      ],\n      "Drug-Name": [\n        "mebendazole"\n      ],\n      "Allergy": [\n        "Allergy"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
