he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\nTo Novato workers\n-  1 to 2 days in the company\n-  Not have previous experience in a frigorifico, or butcher\'s shop\n-  Not have prior knowledge of the activity. To experienced workers\n-  Work on the task for more than six months\n-  Be present in company during the study period\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "To Novato workers",\n                  "Location": [\n                    "Novato"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- 1 to 2 days in the company",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "1 to 2 days"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "1",\n                    "2"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "to"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "days"\n                  ],\n                  "Encounter": [\n                    "company"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "-",\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "-"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "NOT": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "Not have previous experience in a frigorifico,",\n      