he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Received nutrition care previously during current admission\n-  Pregnant women\n-  Prisoners\n-  Infants currently in the neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) with a diagnosis of prematurity\n-  Neonates of uncertain viability or non-viable neonates\n-  Patients receiving palliative/hospice care\n-  Patient admitted for long-term acute care (LTAC)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Received nutrition care previously during current admission",\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "Received",\n                            "current"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "nutrition care"\n                          ],\n                          "Encounter": [\n                            "admission"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "Received"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "nutrition care"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "h"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                            "d"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    