he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Displays or shows evidence of psychotic symptoms\n-  Undergoing surgeries that commonly require local anesthesia only\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Displays or shows evidence of psychotic symptoms",\n      "Condition": [\n        "psychotic"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "psychotic"\n      ],\n      "Assertion": [\n        "symptoms"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Undergoing surgeries that commonly require local anesthesia only",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "surgeries",\n        "local anesthesia"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "surgeries",\n        "local anesthesia"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "Undergoing"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "Undergoing"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
