he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Medical conditions that prohibit physical activity (assessed by Health History Questionnaire)\n-  Pregnant women or women expecting/trying to become pregnant\n-  BMI greater than or equal to 35 kg/m^2\n-  Current smoker (assessed by Health History Questionnaire)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Medical conditions that prohibit physical activity (assessed by Health History Questionnaire)",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Medical conditions"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "physical activity"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "physical activity"\n              ],\n              "Contraindication": [\n                "prohibit"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "prohibit"\n              ],\n              "Stability": [\n                "prohibit"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Medical conditions"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Unit": [\n                "g"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "Health History Questionnaire"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "Health History Questionnaire"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Pregnant women",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Pregnant"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Pregnant"\n  